// Her chase camera: the standard template with her own body offsets, a waist pivot, close targets at her head (fade)
// and just below it (cutaway, which keeps her solid), and a first-person eye in her face. A dual-stick third-person
// action camera: the left stick moves and strafes relative to the camera, the right stick turns the camera and the body
// with it, and the right-stick press recenters it behind her.
import "../../standard/camera"

chaseCamera(
  rig: "moth-camera",
  pivotOffset: [0, 1, 0],
  fadeCloseTarget: [0, 1.74, 0],
  cutawayCloseTarget: [0, 1.55, 0],
  eyePoint: [0, 1.75, 0.22]
)
